{"id":"7b1e5646c6075a74","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-exact-functor.md","title":"Exact Functor","display":"df-exact-functor — Exact Functor","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-exact-functor","aliases":["58-df-exact-functor"],"display":"df-exact-functor — Exact Functor","depends_on":["[[58-df-exact-sequence]]","[[58-df-functor]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-exact-functor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-exact-functor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-exact-functor — Exact Functor"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fc4e59ceee1c854e\" href=\"?note=fc4e59ceee1c854e\" title=\"58-df-exact-sequence\">58-df-exact-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"58-df-functor\">58-df-functor</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B\\in V\\)</span> (category structures)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\">\\(F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\)</span> (object and arrow maps of a covariant functor)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Exact}_{\\mathcal A},\\mathsf{Exact}_{\\mathcal B}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathsf{Exact}_{\\mathcal A},\\mathsf{Exact}_{\\mathcal B}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (explicit exact-sequence interfaces on the two categories, instantiated from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fc4e59ceee1c854e\" href=\"?note=fc4e59ceee1c854e\" title=\"58-df-exact-sequence\">58-df-exact-sequence</a> in module categories)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\)</span> (functor predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"58-df-functor\">58-df-functor</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExactFunctor}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ExactFunctor}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (exact-functor predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}exact\\text{-}functor}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ExactFunctor}_S(\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\mathsf{Exact}_{\\mathcal A},\\mathsf{Exact}_{\\mathcal B})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Functor}_S(\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in V^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\\forall u\\in V^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathsf{Exact}_{\\mathcal A}(a,u)\\to\n\\mathsf{Exact}_{\\mathcal B}\\bigl((F_0(a_n))_{n\\in\\mathbb Z},(F_1(u_n))_{n\\in\\mathbb Z}\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}exact\\text{-}functor}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ExactFunctor}_S(\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\mathsf{Exact}_{\\mathcal A},\\mathsf{Exact}_{\\mathcal B})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Functor}_S(\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in V^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\\forall u\\in V^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathsf{Exact}_{\\mathcal A}(a,u)\\to\n\\mathsf{Exact}_{\\mathcal B}\\bigl((F_0(a_n))_{n\\in\\mathbb Z},(F_1(u_n))_{n\\in\\mathbb Z}\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Exact functors preserve the explicitly supplied class of exact sequences.</li>\n<li>The exactness interfaces are arguments rather than undeclared <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ob}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ob}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mor}\\)</span>, or <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ShortExact}\">\\(\\mathrm{ShortExact}\\)</span> black boxes.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}(A,-)\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}(A,-)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}(-,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}(-,A)\\)</span> are left exact, while tensor product is right exact.</li>\n<li>This definition does not rely on undeclared left- and right-exactness black boxes.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-exact-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"fc4e59ceee1c854e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-exact-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-exact-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"fc4e59ceee1c854e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{Exact}_{\\mathcal A},\\mathsf{Exact}_{\\mathcal B}\\subseteq V^2$ (explicit exact-sequence interfaces on the two categories, instantiated from [[58-df-exact-sequence]] in module categories)","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Functor}_S$ (functor predicate, see [[58-df-functor]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Exact}_{\\mathcal A},\\mathsf{Exact}_{\\mathcal B}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExactFunctor}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}exact\\text{-}functor}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{ExactFunctor}_S(\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\mathsf{Exact}_{\\mathcal A},\\mathsf{Exact}_{\\mathcal B})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Functor}_S(\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a\\in V^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\\forall u\\in V^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathsf{Exact}_{\\mathcal A}(a,u)\\to\n\\mathsf{Exact}_{\\mathcal B}\\bigl((F_0(a_n))_{n\\in\\mathbb Z},(F_1(u_n))_{n\\in\\mathbb Z}\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ob}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ShortExact}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hom}(A,-)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hom}(-,A)","display":false}],"bytes":1716,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-499","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-exact-functor.md|58-df-exact-functor]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["fc4e59ceee1c854e","877f1061e295cf5f"]}